{
  "name": "dsh-token-stats",
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "description": "按自然日统计 LLM token 用量（按提供商/模型/会话，含子代理对账）：悬浮用量宠物（史莱姆，情绪随用量与实时工作状态变化，v0.8.0 参考 Codex 桌宠打磨：描边/暗影/地面阴影/hover 探头/双击逗宠物爱心/工作小电脑进度条动画/带图标完成提示；多任务/子代理完成有提示）+ 显示/隐藏宠物开关 + 设置页\"用量统计\"分区（刷新按钮/命中率进度条/7 天合计/今日高亮/响应式列隐藏）+ 插件配置表单 + /usage 命令",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./client": {
      "default": "./lib/client.js"
    },
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "client": {
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/index.js",
    "lib/client.js"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "token",
    "usage",
    "stats"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc",
    "test": "node test-standalone.mjs",
    "verify:real": "node verify-real.mjs",
    "verify:ui": "python verify-ui.py"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/FantasyStarry/dsh-token-stats.git"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-settings": "0.1.0-rc.6",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "3.18.1",
    "@types/node": "^26.2.0",
    "@types/react": "^19.2.18",
    "typescript": "^7.0.2"
  }
}
